anguage Fixup{a]         4.5.7 [a [href}#properties{href]}Properties Preserved by the Infoset{a] 5 [a [href}#conformance{href]}Conformance{a]     5.1 [a [href}#markup{href]}Markup Conformance{a]     5.2 [a [href}#application{href]}Application Conformance{a]     5.3 [a [href}#infoset{href]}XML Information Set Conformance{a]{p]
